@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Criar um novo Tutor1
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tutores
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Mauricio",
  "cpf": "555444666-44",
  "rg": "9564256",
  "email": "mauricio@email.com",
  "telefone": "48 99999 9999",
  "endereco": "Rua Jose Beiro, 521"
}


